00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:26,000
Shocking. Depraved. Sickening. And they're only Kids.

2
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:46,000
Kids is a drama, crime film directed by Larry Clark.

3
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:06,000
A day in the life of a group of teens as they travel around New York
City skating, drinking, smoking and deflowering virgins.

4
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:26,000
Telly, played by Leo Fitzpatrick.

5
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:46,000
Casper, played by Justin Pierce.

6
